        ecuType: "Bosch HFM (A massive leap forward in reliability. It separately manages fuel injection and ignition using standard sensors. This specific Fleet variant has a slightly detuned map to hit the 89 kW tax bracket, but mechanically it is identical to the standard 90 kW version.)",
