        tuningPotential: [{ stage: "Stage 1 (Software Flash)", power: "320 - 325 hp", notes: "Virtually pointless natively. The true tuning potential of the C 43 is unbolting the 4.3L engine entirely and dropping in the 5.4L M113 V8 from the E 55 AMG, creating a 354hp C 55 monster with no custom fabrication required.", zeroToHundred: "6.5s", hundredToTwoHundred: "16.0s" }],
