          "Valve Cover & Breather Chamber Oil Leaks: The M113 is notorious for weeping oil from the valve cover gaskets and the resealable breather chambers, causing a burning smell.",
          "PCV Breather Hose Degradation: Rubber hoses connecting the valve covers to the throttle body become brittle, causing vacuum leaks.",
          "16 Spark Plugs Maintenance: Twin-spark V8 requires 16 spark plugs and 16 ignition wires. Neglecting this stresses the 8 ignition coils.",
