        injectionType: "Indirect Injection (Pre-chamber injection via a purely mechanical Bosch inline injection pump. This system is legendary for its reliability. It completely lacks complex electronics, ECU management, or high-pressure common rail components. It is entirely immune to modern diagnostic nightmares and will run on virtually any combustible diesel-like fluid.)",
        engineLifespan: "1 000 000+ km (The OM601 is globally recognized as one of the most indestructible internal combustion engines ever created by humanity. The cast-iron block and incredibly robust internal components are subjected to so little stress that wear is virtually nonexistent. The engine will outlast the vehicle's bodywork several times over.)",
        turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (No turbocharger. The OM601 relies entirely on incredibly high 22.0:1 compression to generate its 123 Nm of torque. Power delivery is agonizingly slow but completely linear and absolutely unstoppable.)",
