          "Bosch ERE Pump Leaks: The internal rubber O-rings and seals inside the electronically controlled inline pump harden and leak diesel fuel externally over decades of use.",
          "Biodegradable Engine Wiring Harness (Pre-1997): Between 1995 and 1996, the main engine wiring harness insulation turns to dust from engine heat, causing massive short circuits.",
          "Plastic Fuel Line O-Rings: The low-pressure clear plastic fuel lines use rubber O-rings that harden and crack. They draw air bubbles into the fuel system, causing the engine to lose prime and refuse to start.",
