      { stage: "Stage 3 (Larger Turbo & Injectors)", power: "210 - 230 hp", notes: "Requires bolting on the larger GT18V or GT20V turbocharger from the 2.7L OM612 engine and installing high-flow injector nozzles. The stock OM611 cast-iron block handles this massive torque effortlessly.", zeroToHundred: "7.2s", hundredToTwoHundred: "21.5s" }
