      "EGR Valve & DPF Clogging: The electronically actuated EGR valve constantly pumps soot back into the intake. If driven only in the city, the EGR chokes the engine, and the Diesel Particulate Filter (if equipped) clogs, forcing Limp Mode.",
      "722.6 Automatic Transmission 13-Pin Connector Leak: The 5-speed electronic transmission frequently leaks ATF from the 13-pin pilot bushing. Capillary action draws the fluid up the wiring harness directly into the TCM.",
