      "Eaton M45 Supercharger Bearing Failure: The continuously spinning supercharger exhausts its internal oil supply, causing the planetary gears to run dry and self-destruct.",
      "Command Controller Knob Failure: The scrolling shaft inside the infotainment command knob breaks, preventing you from scrolling through menus on the screen."
