      "High-Pressure Fuel Pump (HPFP) Failure: THE critical flaw of the CGI system. The mechanical fuel pump leaks internally, sending raw gasoline directly into the engine oil. This destroys oil lubricity and wipes out the engine main and rod bearings.",
