      "Intake Manifold Swirl Flaps: The variable length intake manifold uses plastic actuator arms. The heat cycles make the plastic brittle, causing the arms to snap off. This requires an aluminum arm repair kit.",
      "Electronic Steering Lock (ESL/ELV) Failure: THE defining flaw of the W204. The tiny electric motor inside the steering column lock burns out, completely immobilizing the vehicle. The key turns, but the car will not crank.",
